      "id": "p00037-11bb9e7b46b6",
      "source": "Polonius is my father, and the King's advisor. He can be a bit addle-brained at times, and he loves to talk—a lot—but he really just likes being around people, I think. He always means well. \n\nAnd he's been an attentive father to my brother Laertes and me... sometimes a little <i>too</i> attentive. It can be stifling.",
